# Built frontend — generated by build_frontend.py from src/template.html + dataset.
# The build embeds dataset records as JSON; if the dataset contains real PII
# (e.g. gov_emails_300.jsonl), committing this file would leak that data.
# Rebuild locally with:
#   python3 build_frontend.py --dataset <path> --output src/index.html
src/index.html
